1810	1967	He was re-elected as Governor of Central Macedonia in the regional elections of May 2019 and October 2023, receiving over 60% of the vote in both elections.

1967	2154	In November 2019, he was elected President of the Association of Greek Regions and was unanimously re-elected President in February 2024, for the first time in the institution's history.

2154	2291	Since 2015, he has been a member of the European Committee of the Regions, and in July 2017, he was elected Head of the Greek Delegation.
2292	2412	In February 2020, he was unanimously elected by all political groups President of the European Committee of the Regions.
2413	2522	In July 2022, he was also unanimously elected First Vice-President of the European Committee of the Regions.

2522	2658	In August 2024 the Greek government nominated Tzitzikostas as the country’s European Commissioner in the von der Leyen Commission II.



